<title>USA: Boeing plans shareholder meeting on merger.</title>
<headline>Boeing plans shareholder meeting on merger.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co said Wednesday it would hold a special shareholders' meeting Friday to vote on issuance of new shares to complete the merger between Boeing and McDonnell Douglas Corp.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the meeting would start at 9 a.m. local time at the Boeing Plant 2 Cafeteria lobby, 7755 E. Marginal Way S., Seattle.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
